Package: alforja
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Tiago <tiago@local>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, util-linux
Description: Native GTK4/Libadwaita graphical manager for llama.cpp
 Alforja (Andean saddlebag) is a native Linux desktop application built with
 Python, GTK4, and Libadwaita to manage and configure local llama.cpp servers.
 Features network sandboxing via unshare, granular process lifecycle control
 (including SIGSTOP pause to freeze VRAM state), hardware-aware performance
 presets for 4GB GPUs (Nvidia GTX 1650), and an integrated model downloader.
